            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Start recording no longer freezes the menu for about three seconds with Bluetooth headphones. The menu now says &quot;Starting recording…&quot; while the headset switches its microphone on, and a second click in that moment no longer stops the recording it just started.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
