        <item>
            <title>0.15.80</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:14:37 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>241</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.15.80</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Drop audio or video files onto the Corder window to transcribe them. Each file becomes its own session with speakers, a title and a summary, the same as a recording. Works with mp3, m4a, wav, aiff, flac and the sound of mp4 or mov files. Several files at once are transcribed one after another.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
